{"id":5961054350,"name":"(Soon.) Floppa: Tower Defense","desc":"I read any feedback sent on the DC server or the report system!\n\nPlan your defenses to protect floppa house from the evil bingus, will you be able to survive? or will you fail and get the house destroyed? \n\nThe game is kind of difficult, so i suggest new players to get into a full team instead of playing solo. \n\ngame is still developing, so there will be def bugs! theres just 1 person writing the game code right now (me), so dont be too harsh, its hard to make a game. \n\nControls: \nShift - Run \nM1/E/Double Touch - Place a tower or Select a tower \nQ - Cancel placement for a tower / Change Tower Target\nE - Upgrade Selected Tower\nR - Selling Selected Tower\n1, 5 - Select a Tower\n\nShift + P - Free Cam (PC ONLY!!)\n\nThe team: \nRamielz - Lead Dev/Scripter \nDogGood - Icons/Models \nPoly - Lobby Music \nContributors! for the good ideas like some maps or towers!","path":"/game/5961054350-soon-floppa-tower-defense","slug":"5961054350-soon-floppa-tower-defense","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-53ccf10b09c4e0b67b5210106101bd53/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3827c379d52f42af2d755b9c4743c125/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":9135598,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-05-04T19:55:07.743Z","creator":{"name":"ramielzs","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"(Soon.)-Floppa:-Tower-Defense-Floppa-Tower-Defense-212226","_id":"69f8f99b1707c93e9cd7600a","title":"Floppa Tower Defense (THE GAME HAS BEEN DELETED!)","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c788a9","gameId":5961054350,"name":"(Soon.) Floppa: Tower Defense","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-3827c379d52f42af2d755b9c4743c125-1213b76e8de1.png","placeId":5961054350},"features":"The best Floppa Tower Defense script.\nIt includes:\n• Spawn ANY tower for free\n• Get absolutely ANY event item in your i